title: "FamilyDashBoard"
version: "4.2.0"
date-released: "2026-04-07"
abstract: "Single-file Hebrew RTL family dashboard for always-on TV display. Zero dependencies, dark glassmorphism theme, real-time data from 8 free APIs including weather, news, stocks, currency, Shabbat times, red alerts, and motivational quotes. Features per-pane smart refresh with persistent cache."
